@startuml
title Vina Bim Shop Physical Data Model - Bronze, Silver, And Gold

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide circle

class "__physical_pdm_anchor__" as physical_pdm_anchor <<metadata>>
hide physical_pdm_anchor

legend right
  <<PK>> physical primary key
  <<FK>> physical foreign key
  <<AK>> alternate/unique key
  <<NK>> natural/source key
  <<SCD2>> SCD Type 2 support column
endlegend

note right of physical_pdm_anchor
PK/FK lines are physically enforced/represented in the local DuckDB artifact for ERD and validation.
Spark/Iceberg/Trino follows the same logical model and parity checks, but the lakehouse does not rely on database-enforced FK constraints.
end note

note top
Bronze and Silver are views; Gold is physically constrained in DuckDB for DBeaver ERD lines.
obt_order_performance is a derived non-canonical OBT.
agg_hourly_reconciled_kpi is reconciliation evidence for realtime-vs-batch comparison.
feat_* tables are ML/AI preparation tables and keep customer_id as their feature entity key.
This model runs on both dbt-DuckDB (local compatibility) and Spark -> Iceberg -> Trino (canonical).
Row counts match across both paths; see evidence/05_spark_batch/dbt_parity_report.md.
end note

